text "Power: LiPo -> J1 -> SW2(SPDT) -> VBAT_SW. XIAO powered via J4-pin7(VBUS) from VBAT_SW." @ 10.16,175.26 uid fad110c7-5659-4c2f-8529-d43180da32a2
text "3V3 rail sourced from XIAO onboard LDO output (J4 pin 5)." @ 10.16,180.34 uid f211f88d-be2f-478b-abfb-b473ed7698c5
text "XIAO GPIO map: D0-D6 on J3, D7-D10+pwr on J4. D3(GPIO4)=BUTTON, D4(GPIO5)=AMP_SD, D5(GPIO6)=VBAT_SENSE, D8(GPIO7)=MIC_SCK, D9(GPIO8)=MIC_WS, D10(GPIO9)=MIC_SD. D6/D7(GPIO43/44)=UART0, unconnected by design." @ 10.16,185.42 uid 8164cc1e-feca-4643-9342-670d49f3e6f3
text "SW2: CK OS102011MS2Q SPDT slide switch, 2.54mm THT straight." @ 10.16,190.5 uid 73036e7f-155c-41a8-b2ec-7d6aeca7c2d3
